@startuml
title ATM State Transition Diagram

[*] --> Initial

state Card_Inserted
state Enter_PIN
state PIN_Verified
state User_Options
state Processing_Withdrawal
state Dispensing_Cash
state Printing_Receipt
state Returning_Card
state Resetting

Initial --> Card_Inserted : card inserted
Card_Inserted --> Enter_PIN : enter PIN
Enter_PIN --> PIN_Verified : PIN verified
PIN_Verified --> User_Options : options provided
User_Options --> Processing_Withdrawal : withdrawal selected
Processing_Withdrawal --> Dispensing_Cash : cash dispensed
Dispensing_Cash --> Printing_Receipt : receipt printed
Printing_Receipt --> Returning_Card : card returned
Returning_Card --> Resetting : system reset
Resetting --> [*] : ready for next user

@enduml
